WEBVTT

00:07.382 --> 00:10.218
[static noise]

00:17.434 --> 00:20.186
[rodent squeaking]

00:26.943 --> 00:27.944
[exhales sharply]

00:29.612 --> 00:31.781
Hans Jonas discussed
the responsibilities

00:31.865 --> 00:33.533
of life-related technologies.

00:33.616 --> 00:35.285
[distant screeching]

00:35.368 --> 00:38.455
I thus named the Jonas Virus
after this philosopher.

00:39.539 --> 00:42.459
It's also my responsibility
to create an antidote.

00:44.627 --> 00:45.712
I refuse to fail.

00:45.795 --> 00:47.005
[metal clangs]

01:06.441 --> 01:08.860
[crunching]

01:13.281 --> 01:15.283
[squishing]

01:16.826 --> 01:18.828
[tense music]

01:22.957 --> 01:26.294
I'M SO SEXY

01:43.686 --> 01:45.522
[growling]

01:49.025 --> 01:51.528
-Hey, hey, hey! Help me!
-[grunts]

01:53.071 --> 01:54.906
-[squelches]
-[grunts]

01:54.989 --> 01:56.658
-Shit.
-[growling]

01:59.869 --> 02:01.037
Let's go.

02:24.519 --> 02:25.812
[sobbing]

02:35.113 --> 02:37.115
[somber music]

02:49.210 --> 02:51.588
[woods clattering]

02:51.671 --> 02:53.798
[screeching]

02:54.883 --> 02:57.218
-[button beeps on]
-[screeching on video]

02:57.302 --> 02:58.136
[button beeps off]

03:15.570 --> 03:16.905
[gasping]

03:36.466 --> 03:38.468
[theme music]

03:40.011 --> 03:42.889
[squelching]

03:53.399 --> 03:56.402
[all snarling]

04:18.883 --> 04:20.134
Ji-min!

04:20.218 --> 04:21.594
-Stop her! Hey!
-What are you doing?

04:21.678 --> 04:23.012
-Let go.
-[Joon-yeong] What's with you?

04:23.096 --> 04:24.180
I said let go of me!

04:24.264 --> 04:25.431
[On-jo] Please come down.

04:25.515 --> 04:29.394
-I want to die! Leave me alone!
-[Su-hyeok] Don't be like this.

04:29.477 --> 04:31.688
I don't wanna live!

04:31.771 --> 04:34.691
-[Joon-yeong] Ji-min. Come on.
-I want to die!

04:34.774 --> 04:37.694
Please leave me alone! Please!

04:38.194 --> 04:39.821
Let go of me!

04:40.571 --> 04:44.826
Please let me go!
[sobbing]

04:45.910 --> 04:47.912
My mom and dad died.

04:50.373 --> 04:52.917
What am I supposed to do alone?

04:57.839 --> 04:59.549
[On-jo] Why would you die, you idiot?

05:00.425 --> 05:01.843
[Ji-min] What's the use in living?

05:02.385 --> 05:03.886
[On-jo] Still, you should live, anyway.

05:04.762 --> 05:06.014
[Ji-min] I have nobody.

05:06.973 --> 05:07.849
[Ji-min sobs]

05:07.932 --> 05:10.935
I don't have a mom or a dad.

05:12.478 --> 05:15.064
I have nowhere to go
and no one waiting for me.

05:16.566 --> 05:19.694
No one to scold me or praise me.

05:21.195 --> 05:22.447
Do you know what that's like?

05:25.908 --> 05:26.826
No, I don't.

05:27.869 --> 05:29.954
Then don't act like you know everything.

05:30.621 --> 05:32.165
Don't tell me what to do.

05:33.249 --> 05:34.959
You don't know what it's like being me.

05:35.043 --> 05:36.627
-No.
-[Ji-min] Exactly.

05:37.545 --> 05:39.047
So just leave me alone.

05:40.798 --> 05:44.135
Every exam, I'm always last.

05:45.428 --> 05:48.014
Well, not completely last.

05:51.142 --> 05:53.102
Whenever I get my report card, my dad says

05:53.728 --> 05:56.064
that my grades won't get me
into Seoul University,

05:56.147 --> 05:58.107
so I shouldn't even bother having hope.

05:59.859 --> 06:02.487
He says to make sure
I don't get hurt or sick.

06:04.280 --> 06:05.907
To just stay healthy.

06:06.532 --> 06:07.700
No offense.

06:08.451 --> 06:10.119
I don't care about your dad.

06:11.037 --> 06:12.497
I didn't believe him.

06:14.415 --> 06:16.459
I'm sure he'd love it if I got into Seoul.

06:17.627 --> 06:19.462
He was only saying that.

06:21.672 --> 06:22.924
But…

06:23.007 --> 06:23.883
[sniffs]

06:25.259 --> 06:27.345
He would also say to me…

06:32.308 --> 06:34.143
if anything ever happens,

06:38.189 --> 06:40.441
he would be the first one there for me.

06:41.734 --> 06:42.902
But he's not.

06:45.988 --> 06:46.906
He's not.

06:50.493 --> 06:51.452
Who knows?

06:53.454 --> 06:54.831
Maybe he can't come.

06:58.668 --> 06:59.794
What if my…

07:00.628 --> 07:01.838
my dad died?

07:04.298 --> 07:06.217
At least you can have hope.

07:08.761 --> 07:10.012
My hope is dead.

07:13.391 --> 07:14.392
Is there hope?

07:20.189 --> 07:22.275
Is it stupid of me to wait for him?

07:23.901 --> 07:26.028
Or should I run away? Give up?

07:27.488 --> 07:29.115
I don't know anything.

07:30.992 --> 07:33.035
Both I-sak and Gyeong-su are killed.

07:34.579 --> 07:35.580
[sighs]

07:35.663 --> 07:38.207
I don't want any of my friends to die.

07:41.586 --> 07:42.670
Why are you crying?

07:43.254 --> 07:44.589
Don't die, Ji-min.

07:44.672 --> 07:45.882
[sobs]

07:48.301 --> 07:50.428
I don't want my friends to keep dying.

07:51.429 --> 07:52.430
No one.

08:00.146 --> 08:01.189
I gotta go.

08:03.441 --> 08:05.485
I feel like I'm going crazy in here.

08:07.111 --> 08:08.196
Okay, then.

08:10.823 --> 08:11.866
So let's leave.

08:13.743 --> 08:15.161
I really hate it here.

08:17.788 --> 08:20.416
-[speaker squeaks]
-[Ji-min] But how do we get out?

08:21.876 --> 08:23.920
We have nowhere to go, anyway.

08:29.842 --> 08:31.511
[sobbing]

08:35.640 --> 08:37.475
Ji-min. The mic went off in there.

08:37.558 --> 08:39.560
[tense music]

08:46.859 --> 08:49.278
[speaker squeaking]

08:49.987 --> 08:51.155
[groans]

08:51.239 --> 08:52.740
Ugh, stay!

08:53.491 --> 08:56.118
-Can't you people smell? It stinks.
-[Wu-jin coughs]

08:56.202 --> 08:57.787
[Wu-jin] Breathe through your mouth.

08:57.870 --> 08:58.871
What is it?

09:00.373 --> 09:03.501
-[button clicks]
-I think I have a plan to escape.

09:05.836 --> 09:08.673
This is where we are.
This is where Cheong-san is.

09:09.257 --> 09:13.177
If we turn our music only on this speaker,
the zombies will go left.

09:13.261 --> 09:15.179
Then we'll take the stairs on the right,

09:15.263 --> 09:18.558
get Cheong-san, and go to the roof
using the center stairs.

09:19.392 --> 09:20.977
But why the roof?

09:21.060 --> 09:22.770
Choppers keep flying around.

09:23.479 --> 09:25.856
If we light a roof fire,
they might come save us.

09:26.440 --> 09:29.735
Speakers. Will the zombies really go
towards the sound?

09:30.319 --> 09:32.738
I think she's right.
They're drawn to sound.

09:32.822 --> 09:35.908
That's right. They come running
whenever they hear us.

09:35.992 --> 09:38.869
Can we turn on only the speakers we need?

09:38.953 --> 09:42.081
Yes. The ones in the cafeteria,
yard, and library, too.

09:42.164 --> 09:43.666
And draw them there.

09:44.166 --> 09:46.752
Nam-ra, you were
in the broadcasting club, right?

09:47.420 --> 09:49.755
Uh, yeah, my mom made me.

09:49.839 --> 09:51.382
That's all good, and all.

09:52.466 --> 09:53.968
Where do we get music?

09:54.719 --> 09:56.637
There's no internet,
so we can't stream it.

09:59.682 --> 10:00.808
Right there.

10:04.437 --> 10:05.354
That thing?

10:06.939 --> 10:09.609
[Dae-su] This is ancient.
Will it even work?

10:18.284 --> 10:19.869
-[speaker squeaking]
-[all groan]

10:19.952 --> 10:21.287
[all growl]

10:23.122 --> 10:24.081
[grunting]

10:38.054 --> 10:39.180
That's good.

10:42.058 --> 10:42.933
Anyone?

10:44.685 --> 10:46.437
I've never done it before.

10:47.021 --> 10:49.357
[Hyo-ryeong] Somebody do it. Dae-su?

10:49.440 --> 10:51.651
Here goes nothing.

10:53.110 --> 10:56.781
Uh, mic test. One, two. One, two.

10:56.864 --> 10:57.990
Cheong-san, are you there?

10:58.074 --> 11:00.576
-[Dae-su] We--
-[Su-hyeok] What are you doing?

11:00.660 --> 11:02.078
H-- Hey.

11:02.161 --> 11:03.537
Cheong-san, do you hear us?

11:04.163 --> 11:05.414
It's Su-hyeok.

11:06.123 --> 11:09.627
We'll come to you, so stay put.

11:09.710 --> 11:10.878
Got it?

11:11.420 --> 11:13.964
Don't come, moron. You're gonna get bit.

11:14.632 --> 11:16.342
I know what you'll say,

11:17.218 --> 11:20.096
but we can't hear you here.

11:20.179 --> 11:21.806
What the hell are you doing, Bare-su?

11:21.889 --> 11:24.975
[Su-hyeok] So don't go anywhere.
Wait for us.

11:26.060 --> 11:29.438
You really can't go anywhere, okay?

11:32.274 --> 11:33.609
We'll come now.

11:34.777 --> 11:35.861
[whispers]
All good.

11:36.445 --> 11:38.114
Anyway, let's go.

11:38.197 --> 11:39.698
The smell of shit makes me wanna hurl.

11:39.782 --> 11:41.242
Dude, it's your shit.

11:41.826 --> 11:43.869
-It's not just mine.
-Yes, it is.

11:43.953 --> 11:45.996
-[Dae-su] Really?
-[Su-hyeok] Yes.

11:46.080 --> 11:47.206
This can't end well.

11:54.588 --> 11:55.714
[On-jo] Cheong-san.

12:00.678 --> 12:02.346
Please stay still.

12:03.597 --> 12:06.142
I know you never listen to me,
but please do it this time.

12:27.204 --> 12:29.623
-What's wrong?
-[sighs]

12:29.707 --> 12:32.084
-Why isn't it working?
-Beats me.

12:35.880 --> 12:38.007
[narrator] Time for meditation.

12:38.090 --> 12:40.092
[tranquil music playing]

12:42.303 --> 12:44.972
[narrator] Once again,
another fun day at school.

12:45.055 --> 12:48.267
-[zombies growling]
-[snickers]

12:49.393 --> 12:52.730
-[narrator] Everyone, close your eyes…
-[knife clinks]

12:52.813 --> 12:55.691
…and calm your hearts.

12:56.192 --> 12:57.193
Okay.

12:58.360 --> 12:59.403
Broadcasting room.

12:59.487 --> 13:02.114
[growling]

13:03.949 --> 13:05.951
[tranquil music playing]

13:06.494 --> 13:08.370
Nam-ra, turn off the right
and middle speakers.

13:08.454 --> 13:10.372
BUILDING CENTER, RIGHT, LEFT

13:15.878 --> 13:16.712
Sound's distant.

13:17.713 --> 13:19.256
Uh-huh. I hear it on the left.

13:19.882 --> 13:21.759
[growling]

13:22.801 --> 13:24.803
-The speakers are working.
-Really?

13:26.472 --> 13:27.473
It worked.

13:28.015 --> 13:29.892
[growling]

13:33.896 --> 13:34.939
[groans]

13:39.026 --> 13:41.195
ONE HEART

13:55.376 --> 13:56.293
[Su-hyeok] Dae-su.

13:56.377 --> 13:57.211
[whispers]
We're good.

13:59.171 --> 14:00.339
[shushes]

14:00.422 --> 14:02.508
-[Su-hyeok] Hold on.
-Why? What?

14:04.760 --> 14:06.512
[groaning]

14:11.559 --> 14:12.393
There's one more.

14:12.476 --> 14:13.686
Huh?

14:16.313 --> 14:18.524
[zombie snarling]

14:27.700 --> 14:30.202
[growling]

14:38.127 --> 14:39.545
[whispers]
I'm going now.

14:40.504 --> 14:42.965
[narrator] You must keep moving forward…

14:43.048 --> 14:43.883
Let's go.

14:43.966 --> 14:45.175
Come on.

14:48.929 --> 14:49.972
Check the left.

14:56.937 --> 14:58.898
[thumping]

14:58.981 --> 15:00.149
[whimpers]

15:00.232 --> 15:01.650
Shit, shit, shit, shit.

15:01.734 --> 15:02.776
Close it. Close it.

15:04.153 --> 15:05.070
Close it.

15:07.823 --> 15:09.533
-I could've totally died.
-[door lock clicks]

15:09.617 --> 15:11.285
You said it was fine, you idiot.

15:11.368 --> 15:13.829
-What? Where?
-There's one right outside.

15:14.496 --> 15:16.248
Look right.
[breathing heavily]

15:17.875 --> 15:21.003
-[snarling]
-[thumping]

15:21.086 --> 15:23.088
[suspenseful music]

15:30.471 --> 15:31.597
What do we do?

15:31.680 --> 15:33.307
You think there's
something wrong with him?

15:33.390 --> 15:34.600
Not any more than you.

15:34.683 --> 15:36.602
-Rude as hell.
-Sorry.

15:36.685 --> 15:39.813
Everyone else followed the sound,
but he's still there by himself.

15:40.314 --> 15:41.398
Maybe he's deaf.

15:41.482 --> 15:44.818
How the fuck could he hear
when the fucker's dead, huh?

15:44.902 --> 15:47.613
What about the other zombies?
They all respond to sound.

15:48.989 --> 15:50.115
Shit. Beats me.

15:50.908 --> 15:52.117
[sighs]
Damn it.

15:53.160 --> 15:54.244
[Dae-su] How do we get out?

15:54.328 --> 15:55.412
Hold on.

15:56.163 --> 15:57.289
Let's wait a little bit.

15:59.959 --> 16:00.876
I'll look.

16:01.752 --> 16:02.586
Let's wait.

16:06.590 --> 16:11.220
[all growling]

16:27.277 --> 16:28.487
We can't be waiting.

16:29.405 --> 16:32.616
Take the others and walk past him
as carefully as possible.

16:33.367 --> 16:34.785
I'll do what I can from here.

16:37.079 --> 16:39.373
[sighs]
All right.

16:43.377 --> 16:44.420
Let's go.

16:47.047 --> 16:52.636
[narrator] …will never perish
even when all else withers and dies.

16:54.096 --> 16:55.264
Hold on tight.

16:56.306 --> 16:57.558
And don't let go.

17:00.978 --> 17:04.815
BROADCASTING ROOM

17:04.898 --> 17:07.735
[zombie snarling]

17:44.021 --> 17:45.647
[clangs]

17:58.202 --> 18:02.539
[screeching]

18:08.087 --> 18:09.046
Go!

18:09.129 --> 18:12.132
[growling]

18:15.302 --> 18:17.137
[whimpering]

18:28.232 --> 18:29.399
[grunts]

18:38.200 --> 18:39.326
Lee Cheong-san.

18:42.371 --> 18:45.707
[panting]

18:45.791 --> 18:47.876
ROOFTOP

18:47.960 --> 18:49.962
[suspenseful music]

19:06.770 --> 19:08.814
[growling]

19:08.897 --> 19:10.566
[breathing heavily]

19:14.611 --> 19:16.655
[grunting]

19:19.283 --> 19:20.826
[growls]

19:23.704 --> 19:26.915
[Su-hyeok panting]

19:28.834 --> 19:31.336
-[blood squirting]
-[pants, grunts]

19:33.005 --> 19:34.298
[exhales heavily]

19:34.381 --> 19:36.091
You moron.

19:38.051 --> 19:39.761
Total loser, huh?

19:40.345 --> 19:42.347
[grunting]

19:45.184 --> 19:46.268
Thank you.

19:46.351 --> 19:48.854
Of course. I saved your ass.

19:50.564 --> 19:52.608
-I'm looking for Cheong-san?
-Cheong-san?

19:53.233 --> 19:54.067
For what?

19:55.110 --> 19:55.986
Death.

19:56.653 --> 19:57.946
What do you mean?

20:01.241 --> 20:02.492
I'm killing him.

20:11.001 --> 20:12.294
You're badly hurt.

20:13.253 --> 20:14.338
Are you okay?

20:16.757 --> 20:17.799
I'm great.

20:18.550 --> 20:20.469
I'm so fucking great.

20:21.762 --> 20:22.638
So Cheong-san?

20:23.805 --> 20:24.806
That's not funny.

20:29.102 --> 20:30.771
You were always like that.

20:31.396 --> 20:33.523
[snickers]
Isn't that right?

20:36.193 --> 20:37.069
"Do this."

20:38.237 --> 20:39.112
"Don't do that."

20:39.988 --> 20:41.323
Always ordering me around.

20:43.492 --> 20:44.660
It's okay, though.

20:46.036 --> 20:47.704
You fought better than I did.

20:49.456 --> 20:51.667
But you can't do that anymore.
[yells]

21:01.260 --> 21:02.761
[groaning]

21:03.845 --> 21:05.013
You're nothing special.

21:15.649 --> 21:17.526
[groaning]

21:22.823 --> 21:25.200
[grunting]

21:25.284 --> 21:27.160
[crunching]

21:29.246 --> 21:31.331
-[yells]
-[groans]

21:36.003 --> 21:38.338
-[Gwi-nam] You're scared?
-[groaning]

21:38.422 --> 21:39.464
That's okay.

21:40.882 --> 21:41.883
Hey.

21:43.427 --> 21:44.344
Aren't you scared?

21:46.096 --> 21:47.639
Crazy asshole.

21:47.723 --> 21:49.016
[grunts]

21:50.225 --> 21:51.685
-Weak asshole.
-[Su-hyeok groaning]

21:52.811 --> 21:54.229
[choking]

21:54.313 --> 21:57.274
-[grunts]
-[whimpers]

21:57.357 --> 21:58.358
[Nam-ra screams]

22:02.195 --> 22:04.698
[Nam-ra groaning]

22:05.907 --> 22:07.868
You little shithead.

22:07.951 --> 22:09.161
Leave her alone!

22:12.706 --> 22:13.957
[thuds]

22:27.804 --> 22:28.972
Let's go.

22:34.144 --> 22:35.228
Hurry up.

22:38.398 --> 22:39.608
Here comes one. Run!

22:39.691 --> 22:41.109
[growling]

22:45.280 --> 22:46.782
Shit, what's the code?

22:48.283 --> 22:50.744
-Three-two-one-zero!
-Three-two-two-zero?

22:50.827 --> 22:52.370
Three-two-one-zero!

22:53.121 --> 22:54.664
Shit. Three, two…

22:55.373 --> 22:58.251
-[grunts]
-[Mi-jin] What is it again?

22:58.335 --> 22:59.628
Three-two-one-zero!

22:59.711 --> 23:01.588
[Mi-jin] Three, two…

23:02.339 --> 23:04.007
[growling]

23:09.888 --> 23:12.599
[Mi-jin] It worked! It's open!

23:12.682 --> 23:13.600
Hey! Hurry!

23:14.976 --> 23:16.394
[zombie snarling]

23:18.313 --> 23:19.523
Hurry! Joon-seong!

23:19.606 --> 23:21.900
[whimpering]
Help me!

23:22.484 --> 23:23.568
[Mi-jin] Come on!

23:24.528 --> 23:25.987
What are you waiting for? Hurry!

23:27.239 --> 23:28.281
Hurry!

23:29.032 --> 23:30.117
Get in here!

23:36.081 --> 23:38.667
[crying]

23:39.501 --> 23:40.544
I'm tired as shit.

23:42.087 --> 23:44.589
-Shit.
-You're crying?

23:46.216 --> 23:47.843
You're crying?

23:48.426 --> 23:50.053
Embarrassing.

23:51.596 --> 23:53.682
Oh, god!

23:53.765 --> 23:55.058
What happened to you, huh?

23:55.892 --> 23:57.435
How do I fix it?

23:57.519 --> 23:58.436
[Mi-jin] Let me see.

23:59.396 --> 24:00.397
Wait. You're stabbed?

24:00.480 --> 24:01.815
[crying]

24:01.898 --> 24:04.192
Why are you getting stabbed and shit?

24:06.736 --> 24:09.656
Get the first aid kit.
I said get the first aid kit!

24:10.323 --> 24:11.700
Where is the kit?

24:11.783 --> 24:13.577
[groaning]

24:15.245 --> 24:16.580
Oh, shit.

24:17.747 --> 24:18.915
[Dae-su] Where were you?

24:20.000 --> 24:20.834
Cheong-san.

24:21.877 --> 24:22.878
Where's On-jo?

24:24.462 --> 24:26.548
-On-jo!
-[groans]

24:28.717 --> 24:29.968
Are you okay? Are you hurt?

24:30.594 --> 24:31.720
Hurt as hell.

24:33.763 --> 24:35.307
How did you guys know I was here?

24:35.390 --> 24:36.391
-[grunts]
-Aah!

24:37.726 --> 24:39.436
[On-jo] I told you not to go.

24:39.519 --> 24:41.229
Why don't you ever listen to me?

24:41.313 --> 24:43.648
-[groaning]
-Hey, save the lovers' quarrel for later.

24:43.732 --> 24:45.483
-Huh?
-Let's go.

24:46.443 --> 24:48.278
-Where?
-[Wu-jin] We have to get to the roof

24:48.361 --> 24:50.697
-before the meditation music ends.
-[Dae-su] Let's go. Hurry.

24:50.780 --> 24:51.615
[On-jo] Wait.

24:51.698 --> 24:53.909
Where's Su-hyeok? Su-hyeok isn't here.

24:54.576 --> 24:55.702
[door opens, closes]

24:55.785 --> 24:57.454
-Where are you going?
-Hey! Hey! Hey!

25:05.420 --> 25:07.589
[tranquil music playing]

25:19.643 --> 25:22.103
Are you crazy? Don't go by yourself.

25:22.187 --> 25:24.439
-Go in! Go inside!
-They're coming.

25:24.522 --> 25:26.691
-[zombies growling]
-Hurry!

25:29.611 --> 25:31.029
The curtains. Come on.

25:34.532 --> 25:36.201
[panting]

25:38.912 --> 25:40.455
[Cheong-san] There's a zombie there.

25:41.498 --> 25:43.792
It's caught under a piano,
so it can't go anywhere.

25:43.875 --> 25:47.295
[thumping]

25:47.379 --> 25:48.463
[sighs]

25:54.719 --> 25:55.804
We can't…

25:57.806 --> 25:58.974
go to the roof?

26:01.226 --> 26:02.936
[Hyo-ryeong]
We're trapped again, aren't we?

26:03.019 --> 26:04.354
[panting]

26:04.437 --> 26:06.314
There are zombies out there, so…

26:08.108 --> 26:09.442
Let's just think a little.

26:09.526 --> 26:10.443
This is so annoying.

26:11.987 --> 26:14.239
[breathing heavily]

26:20.120 --> 26:20.954
Hey.

26:21.830 --> 26:22.706
Hey, Nam-ra.

26:25.292 --> 26:26.293
What happened to your arm?

26:27.252 --> 26:29.170
That's a bite mark, isn't it?

26:40.890 --> 26:43.393
[people clamoring]

26:46.062 --> 26:48.690
[clamoring continues]

26:49.190 --> 26:50.400
[woman grunts]

27:00.076 --> 27:02.287
I can't eat pork. Is there anything else?

27:03.705 --> 27:04.789
Take it and go!

27:04.873 --> 27:06.207
-Hold on.
-Go on. Get out of here.

27:06.291 --> 27:07.292
I can't eat pork!

27:07.375 --> 27:10.170
-Come on, we're all waiting.
-[refugee] That's enough!

27:10.253 --> 27:12.839
[people clamoring]

27:24.351 --> 27:25.435
I'm good.

27:25.518 --> 27:27.312
Are the cell phones working in here?

27:28.021 --> 27:30.982
No. There won't be service here.

27:31.066 --> 27:32.150
[Eun-hee sighs]

27:32.859 --> 27:34.194
So you're telling me…

27:35.737 --> 27:37.781
a politician can't talk
a way out of here?

27:40.408 --> 27:41.284
It's true.

27:41.868 --> 27:43.411
I've never been treated this way before.

27:43.495 --> 27:46.247
There's nothing politicians
can't do in our country, right?

27:46.331 --> 27:47.582
Don't be sarcastic.

27:48.583 --> 27:50.210
I've never done anything illegal.

27:50.293 --> 27:52.754
Never did anything improper my whole life.

27:52.837 --> 27:54.547
Then can't you do it just this one time?

27:55.256 --> 27:56.383
I really need to leave.

27:57.842 --> 27:58.760
Wait a little.

27:59.469 --> 28:01.471
I'll get you a helicopter
after we're tested,

28:01.554 --> 28:03.306
and send you to your daughter's school.

28:03.390 --> 28:04.599
The test isn't the problem.

28:05.392 --> 28:07.936
Even if we test negative,
we'll still have to quarantine here.

28:08.520 --> 28:10.897
It was nine days for MERS,
two weeks for Covid-19,

28:10.980 --> 28:12.774
and even three weeks for Ebola.

28:13.483 --> 28:14.526
And then what?

28:14.609 --> 28:16.945
Are you saying we have to stay here
even after we get tested?

28:17.028 --> 28:19.531
It depends what they consider
the incubation period is.

28:19.614 --> 28:20.698
[gate clanks open]

28:28.832 --> 28:30.125
Please eat as much as possible,

28:30.208 --> 28:32.502
and leave your empty food containers
by the door.

28:33.169 --> 28:34.087
Hold on.

28:37.006 --> 28:37.966
Special Mission?

28:38.675 --> 28:40.135
I was a Master Sergeant when I left.

28:41.010 --> 28:42.846
Are you our senior officer?

28:42.929 --> 28:45.223
He was also Special Mission Unit.

28:45.306 --> 28:46.391
Nice to meet you.

28:46.474 --> 28:49.686
Sorry. I'd buy you a drink
if we had met outside.

28:49.769 --> 28:50.979
[military medic 1] It's fine.

28:51.062 --> 28:54.065
Tell me, how long are they considering
for quarantine?

28:54.149 --> 28:55.442
We don't know, sir.

28:55.525 --> 28:56.651
Sure you do.

28:56.735 --> 28:57.652
[military medic 1] It's true.

28:57.736 --> 29:00.947
They don't know what this virus is,
so they don't know the incubation period.

29:01.030 --> 29:04.367
From what I hear, they're thinking
a minimum of, I don't know, four weeks.

29:04.451 --> 29:07.203
What? That means we have
to be here for at least a month!

29:07.287 --> 29:08.955
Wait until you get tested.

29:09.038 --> 29:09.956
Wait a minute.

29:11.624 --> 29:13.460
-Yes, sir.
-Well…

29:14.586 --> 29:15.754
I'm sorry,

29:16.838 --> 29:19.340
but I have to get out of here
much sooner than that.

29:20.592 --> 29:21.843
[sighs]
Sir.

29:22.594 --> 29:25.555
Even judges and prosecutors
are standing by and waiting.

29:25.638 --> 29:26.973
Connections don't work here.

29:27.056 --> 29:29.851
I know. And I'm very sorry.

29:30.810 --> 29:32.729
-I sincerely apologize.
-For what?

29:35.190 --> 29:36.566
[gasps]

29:36.649 --> 29:38.651
[groaning]

29:40.320 --> 29:41.863
What good do you think that's gonna do?

29:41.946 --> 29:45.200
[choking]

29:46.493 --> 29:47.702
Why are you doing this?

29:49.245 --> 29:51.748
[breathing heavily]

29:52.874 --> 29:56.169
Ma'am, I'm really sorry.
I have to get to the school.

29:56.252 --> 29:58.922
I already said I'd follow protocol
and help you.

29:59.005 --> 30:02.425
Those protocols kept me
from saving too many lives.

30:08.598 --> 30:09.641
I'm leaving.

30:10.683 --> 30:12.852
Please help them out,
so they are not punished,

30:12.936 --> 30:14.771
not too severely at least.

30:16.022 --> 30:18.691
[Eun-hee] You create this mess,
but you want me to clean it up?

30:24.572 --> 30:26.241
I know you're a mother as well.

30:27.784 --> 30:28.660
I'm a father.

30:31.079 --> 30:32.956
[clattering]

30:33.039 --> 30:34.082
[grunts]

30:38.127 --> 30:39.212
[So-ju] Hey.

30:39.295 --> 30:40.380
Why did you do that?

30:41.422 --> 30:42.966
What? He… He tried to get up.

30:44.759 --> 30:45.677
So what now?

30:45.760 --> 30:47.929
Don't even think about coming with me.

30:49.138 --> 30:50.849
You want me to stay here
after what I've done?

30:50.932 --> 30:52.058
[sighs]

30:55.395 --> 30:57.397
[tense music]

31:05.822 --> 31:09.492
[indistinct chatter]

31:17.542 --> 31:20.169
[helicopter whirring]

31:24.173 --> 31:25.592
[U-sin] We can't go that way.

31:40.148 --> 31:41.900
[So-ju] There are no kids
in school uniforms.

31:43.735 --> 31:45.153
No one got out.

31:46.487 --> 31:47.739
No one saved them.

31:50.867 --> 31:51.743
No.

31:51.826 --> 31:53.119
That's not it.

31:53.202 --> 31:54.370
Move. Step back, Su-hyeok.

31:54.454 --> 31:56.122
That's not it, asshole.

31:57.749 --> 31:58.583
Tell him.

31:58.666 --> 32:00.668
You weren't bitten by a zombie.

32:08.843 --> 32:10.094
Say something.

32:11.220 --> 32:12.055
Gwi-nam.

32:12.764 --> 32:14.933
He bit her. It wasn't zombies.

32:15.016 --> 32:16.059
Who?

32:16.601 --> 32:18.353
Gwi-nam. The bully.

32:18.436 --> 32:20.271
-Yoon Gwi-nam?
-Yeah.

32:21.272 --> 32:24.192
Nam-ra. Did Gwi-nam really bite you?

32:27.320 --> 32:28.154
Say it clearly.

32:28.738 --> 32:29.739
It's true.

32:33.701 --> 32:35.536
Gwi-nam was bitten by zombies.

32:39.248 --> 32:41.334
[scoffs]
Bullshit.

32:42.001 --> 32:43.044
I saw him get bit.

32:43.920 --> 32:45.797
If you get bitten by zombies,
you turn into one.

32:45.880 --> 32:47.674
-So if Gwi-nam bit her--
-He's not one of them.

32:47.757 --> 32:50.051
-[zombies growling]
-[banging on door]

32:54.097 --> 32:55.264
Gwi-nam wasn't a zombie.

32:57.350 --> 32:58.643
He wasn't.

32:59.686 --> 33:01.145
He literally talked to me.

33:02.063 --> 33:04.774
You saw him. He wasn't a zombie at all.

33:07.819 --> 33:10.029
Are you sure he was bitten by a zombie?

33:10.113 --> 33:11.364
Yeah.

33:12.824 --> 33:14.367
So I'll turn into a zombie.

33:15.702 --> 33:16.577
You won't.

33:18.955 --> 33:20.164
I…

33:22.750 --> 33:24.252
Never mind. So be it.

33:24.836 --> 33:26.921
Su-hyeok, thank you.

33:29.090 --> 33:30.133
Hold on, prez.

33:36.097 --> 33:38.474
I wonder why you never called me
by my name.

33:47.608 --> 33:48.484
You won't.

33:53.906 --> 33:55.366
She won't turn into one.

33:55.908 --> 33:57.076
Don't you trust me?

33:59.162 --> 34:00.538
I saw when Gwi-nam got bitten.

34:01.789 --> 34:04.917
-It happened after fighting with me.
-I fought him, too. Believe me.

34:05.585 --> 34:06.544
I know.

34:06.627 --> 34:08.629
[tense music]

34:23.853 --> 34:24.854
You see?

34:26.355 --> 34:29.817
If she turns, I'll throw her
out the window, so she can't attack you.

34:31.903 --> 34:33.196
So back off.

34:33.696 --> 34:36.407
-[Cheong-san] Su-hyeok.
-[Su-hyeok] Back off, asshole.

34:38.576 --> 34:39.827
You shouldn't do this.

34:41.412 --> 34:42.872
I owe it to you.

34:51.172 --> 34:52.048
Don't come closer.

34:53.925 --> 34:55.301
I'm warning you.

34:56.844 --> 34:57.970
Screw you.

34:59.013 --> 35:00.306
I warned you first.

35:01.224 --> 35:02.183
Get lost.

35:02.266 --> 35:03.434
Gyeong-su was enough.

35:04.936 --> 35:06.437
I won't lose any more friends.

35:10.608 --> 35:11.901
[Cheong-san] Get out of my way.

35:13.444 --> 35:14.862
I said to stop it--

35:14.946 --> 35:16.155
Get out of my way!

35:16.239 --> 35:17.698
Stop it, both of you!

35:17.782 --> 35:20.368
[zombie growling in distance]

35:33.589 --> 35:35.758
If I feel strange in any way…

35:39.512 --> 35:41.139
I'll just end it quickly.

35:43.850 --> 35:44.725
Sorry, but--

35:44.809 --> 35:46.185
No need to be sorry.

35:48.396 --> 35:50.481
I'm actually not sorry, not at all.

35:53.234 --> 35:54.110
Sorry.

35:55.778 --> 35:56.654
Su-hyeok.

35:58.281 --> 35:59.532
Kill me if I turn.

36:01.868 --> 36:02.827
Hey! Hey!

36:22.013 --> 36:23.222
That's enough.

36:23.973 --> 36:25.266
She should've turned by now.

36:26.517 --> 36:27.351
Not yet.

36:28.144 --> 36:31.564
She was bitten by Gwi-nam,
so she should be fine.

36:32.273 --> 36:33.900
He was bitten by zombies.

36:35.318 --> 36:36.652
Su-hyeok says he wasn't.

36:38.029 --> 36:39.488
I saw it with my own eyes.

36:39.989 --> 36:41.782
Su-hyeok has no reason to lie.

36:42.366 --> 36:43.951
And you're telling me that I do?

36:44.577 --> 36:45.661
Su-hyeok was saying--

36:45.745 --> 36:47.663
I know you like him, but…

36:47.747 --> 36:49.874
This is a little more important,
don't you think?

36:53.211 --> 36:54.587
Why would you bring that up?

36:56.380 --> 36:58.007
Because you always take his side.

37:00.843 --> 37:01.969
I don't do that.

37:02.053 --> 37:03.262
Yes, you do.

37:03.346 --> 37:05.348
[somber music]

37:19.403 --> 37:23.407
[Joon-seong groaning]

37:25.576 --> 37:26.661
[Mi-jin] Does it hurt a lot?

37:27.954 --> 37:29.997
[Joon-seong] I said we shouldn't come out!

37:31.123 --> 37:33.125
I said we would all die!

37:33.209 --> 37:35.086
[Min-jae] We stopped the bleeding
and sterilized the wound.

37:35.169 --> 37:36.545
So you'll be fine
once you get to a hospital.

37:36.629 --> 37:39.382
How can I go to a hospital right now?

37:39.465 --> 37:40.633
What a joke.

37:40.716 --> 37:42.468
Stop complaining. You'll be fine.

37:42.551 --> 37:45.513
[Joon-seong] It's all your fault.
It's your fault.

37:45.596 --> 37:48.849
-Just stop crying. Fuck!
-[phone beeping rapidly]

37:48.933 --> 37:50.393
[clicking]

37:52.186 --> 37:54.063
Hey. Anything?

37:58.109 --> 38:01.028
Of course, it's broken.
I said it wouldn't work, didn't I?

38:01.112 --> 38:03.781
How annoying can you be? You won't die!

38:12.039 --> 38:14.041
[bones crunching]

38:16.085 --> 38:18.087
[eerie music]

38:29.598 --> 38:30.683
[Nam-ra] Su-hyeok.

38:32.268 --> 38:33.227
Su-hyeok.

38:34.395 --> 38:37.064
I feel weird. I'm hungry.

38:41.902 --> 38:42.945
Su-hyeok.

38:44.780 --> 38:46.866
Why do you smell so good?

38:57.501 --> 38:58.336
Nam-ra.

39:00.463 --> 39:01.422
Su-hyeok!

39:04.258 --> 39:06.135
[gasps]

39:07.762 --> 39:09.096
[groaning]

39:12.725 --> 39:14.226
[grunts]

39:24.737 --> 39:25.780
Get out of the way!

39:25.863 --> 39:27.823
-Stop it.
-Get back now!

39:30.868 --> 39:32.203
I said to stop it!

39:32.286 --> 39:33.329
Stupid asshole!

39:33.412 --> 39:34.830
[both grunt]

39:39.210 --> 39:41.629
Hey. Hey, hey, hey. Cut it out.
Stop it already!

39:41.712 --> 39:43.589
-Let go! Let go of me!
-They're going to come in!

39:44.423 --> 39:45.466
Don't do it!

39:45.549 --> 39:47.802
Get out of my way! Let go of me!

39:48.386 --> 39:50.971
Stop it. Are you blind? Look at Nam-ra.

39:51.722 --> 39:53.974
She would have blood
on her mouth if she bit him.

39:54.558 --> 39:58.979
[panting]

40:00.523 --> 40:01.649
Does she?

40:02.775 --> 40:04.360
And he's not bleeding, right?

40:04.443 --> 40:06.362
It's true. There's no wound.

40:08.239 --> 40:09.657
But if Gwi-nam bit her--

40:09.740 --> 40:11.659
She's still fine,
which means you'll be fine.

40:16.497 --> 40:17.915
Come on, put that down.

40:19.792 --> 40:20.918
Stop being stubborn.

40:27.383 --> 40:28.509
Let go.

40:29.385 --> 40:31.429
I got it. Let go. Fuck.

40:34.348 --> 40:35.558
Why won't you drop that?

40:37.143 --> 40:38.436
That's my business.

40:53.826 --> 40:54.785
Are you okay?

40:55.995 --> 40:58.247
-Why do you care?
-What?

40:59.623 --> 41:00.624
It's weird.

41:01.876 --> 41:03.127
You've always hated me.

41:07.840 --> 41:08.966
Sometimes, I still do.

41:11.469 --> 41:12.887
What's wrong is wrong, though.

41:19.685 --> 41:23.272
She seems fine. Let's…

41:23.355 --> 41:25.274
She would've definitely turned by now.

41:25.900 --> 41:26.734
No.

41:31.197 --> 41:34.742
I'm not okay. I wanted to bite Su-hyeok.

41:34.825 --> 41:36.035
That's not true.

41:37.203 --> 41:38.078
Stop that.

41:38.162 --> 41:39.914
I really did.

41:41.248 --> 41:42.750
I wanted to bite him.

41:43.334 --> 41:44.627
Wait, what do you mean by that?

41:45.336 --> 41:46.295
I mean…

41:49.465 --> 41:50.549
I wanted to bite him.

41:50.633 --> 41:52.051
[sighs]

41:57.348 --> 41:59.975
I shouldn't stay with you any longer.

42:00.059 --> 42:02.478
If I hadn't come to my senses,
I would've bitten him.

42:02.561 --> 42:05.272
Hey, come on, stop that.
What's wrong with you?

42:06.482 --> 42:07.358
[sighs]

42:08.150 --> 42:09.151
I'll go.

42:09.235 --> 42:10.528
Please wait.

42:13.030 --> 42:15.157
You saw Gwi-nam get bitten by zombies?

42:15.241 --> 42:16.659
I told you a hundred times, yes.

42:17.243 --> 42:18.410
And you saw Gwi-nam turn?

42:19.662 --> 42:20.829
No, I didn't.

42:21.330 --> 42:22.456
I was busy running away.

42:24.875 --> 42:27.628
Su-hyeok, you definitely fought Gwi-nam?

42:28.212 --> 42:30.172
Yes, I did.

42:32.383 --> 42:34.468
There's no reason for either to lie.

42:35.177 --> 42:37.513
Maybe Gwi-nam was bitten,
but was not affected.

42:38.097 --> 42:40.849
In the movies, there are always people
who are immune, remember?

42:42.434 --> 42:43.811
Still, she tried to bite him.

42:44.979 --> 42:46.814
She could have bitten him for real.

42:47.856 --> 42:49.692
Regardless, she isn't normal.

42:50.776 --> 42:51.902
So I'm not going with her.

42:51.986 --> 42:53.028
Ji-min, stop.

42:53.112 --> 42:55.030
What? Are you saying that I'm wrong?

42:58.284 --> 42:59.201
Maybe.

43:01.662 --> 43:03.163
I really don't know what we should do.

43:03.789 --> 43:05.291
We can't pretend she's fine.

43:05.958 --> 43:06.792
Enough.

43:11.213 --> 43:12.673
Please don't fight.

43:18.762 --> 43:20.472
Leaving will solve everything.

43:25.728 --> 43:27.605
Don't go. Where would you go?

43:28.314 --> 43:29.315
Stop it.

43:29.398 --> 43:30.232
Please.

43:34.236 --> 43:35.738
I don't want anyone dying.

43:35.821 --> 43:39.575
[breathing shakily]

43:43.537 --> 43:44.788
Hyeon-ju and I-sak…

43:45.706 --> 43:47.708
They're hands were very cold
before they turned.

43:51.170 --> 43:52.588
Nam-ra's hands are warm.

43:53.088 --> 43:54.340
She isn't a zombie.

43:55.049 --> 43:57.301
So cut it out,
and let's talk how to get to the roof.

43:57.384 --> 43:59.094
-No.
-Ji-min!

43:59.178 --> 44:00.262
No way!

44:01.055 --> 44:03.349
She may be fine now,
but who knows what's gonna happen

44:03.432 --> 44:04.433
when she turns?

44:05.309 --> 44:08.228
Guys, say something. This is wrong.

44:08.312 --> 44:10.564
She said herself
that she wanted to bite him.

44:10.648 --> 44:12.983
She has zombie blood in her veins.

44:13.734 --> 44:15.319
Zombies killed my mom and dad.

44:16.779 --> 44:18.072
My mom.

44:20.157 --> 44:23.494
[somber music]

44:27.623 --> 44:28.624
[sighs]

44:33.629 --> 44:34.546
Hey.

44:36.298 --> 44:37.466
Give me your hand.

44:38.509 --> 44:40.594
-What are you doing?
-Tying a knot.

44:41.887 --> 44:44.640
Stop it. Stop.

44:45.933 --> 44:48.519
-[grunts]
-Hold still.

45:01.740 --> 45:04.576
Happy? This way,
she can't get to you if she turns.

45:06.912 --> 45:08.247
I'll get bitten instead.

45:16.839 --> 45:19.258
[somber music continues]

45:29.935 --> 45:31.687
What are you going to do?

45:31.770 --> 45:32.813
I have to go.

45:33.897 --> 45:35.399
Be back in a minute.

45:43.365 --> 45:44.616
It's probably not gonna start, you know?

45:44.700 --> 45:47.744
Why are you so damn pessimistic, huh?

45:47.828 --> 45:50.873
The earlier one was in an accident.
That's obviously fine.

45:51.373 --> 45:53.459
How are we gonna fit two people
on that thing?

45:54.543 --> 45:55.627
Try three.

45:58.046 --> 45:59.756
You wanna take the baby with you?

46:00.340 --> 46:03.343
If we leave the baby here,
it won't survive.

46:03.427 --> 46:04.261
[grunts]

46:06.346 --> 46:07.639
[exhales deeply]

46:11.143 --> 46:12.227
Here.

46:12.311 --> 46:15.522
Sit in the back and kill anyone
who gets too close. Okay?

46:16.690 --> 46:18.775
Oh, I can't go. There's no way.

46:18.859 --> 46:21.528
You coward.
You wanna be reported for desertion?

46:22.404 --> 46:24.573
[scoffs]
Fine, go ahead.

46:25.324 --> 46:27.784
Given the situation I'm currently in,
the court will agree

46:27.868 --> 46:29.328
these were extenuating circumstances.

46:29.411 --> 46:30.704
-Court?
-Yeah.

46:30.787 --> 46:32.080
-Circumstances?
-Yeah.

46:32.164 --> 46:33.332
[scoffs]

46:33.415 --> 46:34.541
You're smart.

46:34.625 --> 46:36.752
Yes, I am. I go to Seoul University.

46:36.835 --> 46:39.421
Okay, then, I'll break
all the windows on my way out,

46:39.505 --> 46:40.839
so that they can get in.

46:43.008 --> 46:45.385
Oh! All right!
All right! I'll go. I'll go.

46:50.974 --> 46:52.309
[Jae-ik] Seriously?

46:54.895 --> 46:56.355
A person should use his head.

46:56.438 --> 46:59.483
We need to stay alive
to tell anyone about the laptop.

46:59.566 --> 47:00.859
CHEONG-SAN CHICKEN

47:00.943 --> 47:03.487
[both grunting]

47:03.570 --> 47:05.697
-[engine starts]
-[zombie growls in distance]

47:05.781 --> 47:07.866
-[crying]
-What's going on?

47:07.950 --> 47:10.077
-[Ho-cheol] Hey. Hey.
-[growling]

47:10.160 --> 47:11.954
-[girl crying]
-Come here!

47:22.464 --> 47:25.342
[panting]

47:26.093 --> 47:28.470
You said we were going,
so we should've just gone.

47:29.263 --> 47:31.431
Are you going to save
everyone in the world?

47:31.515 --> 47:33.267
-Are you the spirit of God?
-Police officer.

47:33.892 --> 47:35.018
Damn it.

47:38.230 --> 47:40.232
-Take the baby.
-Okay.

47:41.942 --> 47:42.985
The baby.

47:43.527 --> 47:44.444
Are you okay?

47:45.279 --> 47:46.280
Are you hurt anywhere?

47:47.864 --> 47:48.949
Mommy.

47:50.576 --> 47:54.204
-Mommy is over there.
-Where?

47:54.913 --> 47:55.831
Where's Mama?

47:58.834 --> 48:00.252
-[baby cries]
-[Jae-ik] Is…

48:00.335 --> 48:01.753
Is that your mom?

48:02.963 --> 48:04.006
The one in red?

48:05.757 --> 48:07.509
[growling]

48:10.137 --> 48:13.682
Sir. I don't know how to hold babies.

48:13.765 --> 48:16.310
-[baby cooing]
-This baby keeps smiling.

48:16.393 --> 48:18.186
-What do I do? What do I do?
-Wait a minute.

48:20.188 --> 48:21.607
Stay still for one minute.

48:24.985 --> 48:26.987
[somber music]

48:38.373 --> 48:39.541
[grumbles]

48:41.627 --> 48:43.295
What is wrong with this world?

49:09.279 --> 49:10.447
It will be okay.

49:11.615 --> 49:14.785
If Nam-ra's immune,
does that mean she's okay

49:15.452 --> 49:16.953
even if she gets bitten?

49:17.037 --> 49:19.498
-Probably.
-Oh, shit.

49:19.581 --> 49:20.957
[Dae-su] That's not fair.

49:21.625 --> 49:24.002
She still has zombie blood in her veins.

49:24.753 --> 49:26.380
She isn't completely a zombie.

49:27.714 --> 49:28.965
A half-bie?

49:29.049 --> 49:30.175
What's half-bie?

49:30.258 --> 49:31.468
Short for half zombie?

49:31.551 --> 49:32.427
Really?

49:32.511 --> 49:33.887
It's like half and half.

49:33.970 --> 49:35.764
Like half spicy, half fried… Oh!

49:35.847 --> 49:38.266
-I want chicken.
-That's enough, Dae-su.

49:38.850 --> 49:40.644
We haven't had water for two days.

49:40.727 --> 49:43.563
Is it true we'll die
if we don't have water for three days?

49:45.148 --> 49:47.317
I don't know.
Please don't talk to me. I'm too hungry.

49:47.401 --> 49:51.822
Dae-su, don't you want that soda
we had on our way to school?

49:51.905 --> 49:53.615
Oh!

49:53.699 --> 49:55.367
-Don't you want it so bad?
-[Dae-su] Yes.

49:57.077 --> 49:59.579
[Joon-yeong] I want Hot Six with Pocari.

50:00.414 --> 50:02.582
[Dae-su] I'll see your soda,
Hot Six, and Pocari,

50:02.666 --> 50:05.168
and raise you an iced vanilla latte.

50:05.252 --> 50:07.546
How could you think about food
with a zombie here?

50:07.629 --> 50:10.006
Stop it. Nam-ra isn't a zombie.

50:10.090 --> 50:10.966
Half-bie.

50:11.049 --> 50:12.175
Close enough.

50:12.259 --> 50:13.969
Let's not do this to ourselves.

50:15.095 --> 50:16.346
We're all we've got now.

50:17.097 --> 50:20.475
She's right.
Nam-ra is better than Na-yeon.

50:20.559 --> 50:23.270
[Ji-min] Don't even say her name.
She's subhuman.

50:23.854 --> 50:26.565
Gyeong-su died, because of her,
and Miss Park…

50:26.648 --> 50:27.649
That's true.

50:28.567 --> 50:32.279
If it weren't for Na-yeon,
they'd be here with us right now.

50:33.363 --> 50:34.448
Wait a sec.

50:34.531 --> 50:37.826
The PTA asked the parents
to send some stuff before the competition,

50:37.909 --> 50:39.995
and asked my mom to send some chicken.

50:40.078 --> 50:40.996
[Wu-jin] Chicken?

50:42.122 --> 50:44.207
[Dae-su] We would've seen it
if it were here.

50:44.291 --> 50:45.792
I don't see anything.

50:47.878 --> 50:48.712
Hold on.

50:51.298 --> 50:52.674
Shit. Maybe it's in there.

50:53.258 --> 50:54.092
Hey, hey.

50:54.176 --> 50:55.886
-What?
-We don't know what's in there.

50:55.969 --> 50:58.054
[Dae-su] We need to eat and survive first.

50:58.138 --> 50:59.097
-[gasps]
-[door lock clicking]

50:59.181 --> 51:02.976
-Damn it. It's locked.
-It's locked, goddamn it.

51:06.104 --> 51:07.272
Let's open it.

51:07.981 --> 51:09.858
[Dae-su] Find something
to pick the lock with.

51:09.941 --> 51:12.152
[Cheong-san] Look for something. Hurry.

51:12.235 --> 51:14.237
[suspenseful music]

51:14.321 --> 51:15.530
[approaching footsteps]

51:21.244 --> 51:22.996
[siren blaring in distance]

51:23.997 --> 51:25.290
[So-ju] What do you think?

51:25.373 --> 51:28.293
-That wall is our only way out, right?
-[U-sin] Yes. That's our best option.

51:29.252 --> 51:31.797
Security is insane.
We're completely trapped.

51:32.464 --> 51:34.341
-[So-ju] Let's go over it.
-[U-sin] Are you sure?

51:34.424 --> 51:37.719
-We'll be seen for sure.
-[So-ju] That's the only way.

51:37.803 --> 51:44.810
RESTRICTED AREA
AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY

52:00.617 --> 52:03.829
[helicopter whirring]

52:11.503 --> 52:12.379
[So-ju grunts]

52:14.506 --> 52:16.508
[So-ju groans, pants]

52:17.008 --> 52:18.426
The line.

52:20.804 --> 52:22.389
Drop me a line.

52:27.519 --> 52:29.145
-U-sin.
-Yes?

52:30.063 --> 52:31.147
Just…

52:32.274 --> 52:33.358
Stay alive.

52:33.984 --> 52:36.278
Are you insane? Take me with you, please.

52:37.279 --> 52:39.489
Captain! Captain!

52:41.950 --> 52:42.993
Captain!

52:47.622 --> 52:48.623
[military medic 2] Freeze.

52:49.499 --> 52:50.333
Freeze!

52:51.334 --> 52:52.711
What are you doing?

52:55.380 --> 52:56.548
Stop right there.

52:57.257 --> 52:58.216
What the hell?

52:58.300 --> 53:00.051
I said to freeze.

53:00.635 --> 53:02.470
I'm on patrol, moron.

53:04.431 --> 53:06.683
Which unit are you with?

53:06.766 --> 53:09.102
-Sorry.
-Pardon?

53:13.398 --> 53:14.900
-[gunshot]
-[grunts]

53:16.401 --> 53:18.403
[suspenseful music]

53:20.196 --> 53:23.158
-[alarm wailing]
-[gunshots]

53:28.121 --> 53:28.997
Nothing?

53:29.080 --> 53:30.040
[grunts]

53:30.123 --> 53:31.499
Should we knock it down?

53:32.834 --> 53:34.878
[growling]

53:36.338 --> 53:37.505
Damn it.

53:38.006 --> 53:40.884
PTA DONATIONS

53:40.967 --> 53:45.055
[banging]

53:46.598 --> 53:48.016
Hey. Take it easy.

53:56.775 --> 53:58.693
Hey. Keep it down! You gotta be quiet.

54:00.695 --> 54:02.030
Hey.

54:02.113 --> 54:03.198
Hey, stop doing that.

54:07.953 --> 54:09.412
-[groans]
-It won't work.

54:09.496 --> 54:10.747
What a waste of energy.

54:12.415 --> 54:13.333
[camera beeps]

54:14.584 --> 54:17.212
[dramatic music playing]

54:20.173 --> 54:22.384
And please, no music.

54:22.467 --> 54:23.593
-[camera beeps]
-[music stops]

54:46.491 --> 54:47.909
My mom and dad…

54:50.370 --> 54:52.706
They came to the school to save me.

54:55.041 --> 54:56.084
The police…

54:58.628 --> 55:00.130
and firefighters never came.

55:03.133 --> 55:05.468
If anybody is watching this after,

55:05.969 --> 55:07.387
punish them.

55:08.430 --> 55:09.848
All involved.

55:10.724 --> 55:11.641
[sniffs]

55:12.350 --> 55:13.810
They abandoned us.

55:15.061 --> 55:15.979
All of them.

55:18.523 --> 55:20.191
I'll make you pay.

55:23.570 --> 55:24.738
[sniffles]

55:32.245 --> 55:33.121
Hi, Mom.

55:35.373 --> 55:36.291
Hi, Dad.

55:40.295 --> 55:42.589
I'll stay alive and get revenge.

55:45.550 --> 55:47.677
I'll kill all the zombies…

55:50.263 --> 55:51.806
and anyone else.

55:55.268 --> 55:57.270
[somber music]

55:58.730 --> 55:59.981
[camera beeps]

56:18.208 --> 56:19.209
Mom.

56:20.418 --> 56:21.294
And Dad.

56:22.378 --> 56:23.296
Hello.

56:25.340 --> 56:28.885
I'm here with some of my classmates
and they're really good to me.

56:30.804 --> 56:32.514
Let me just show you. This is them.

56:40.897 --> 56:41.731
Uh…

56:43.358 --> 56:44.567
Um…

56:44.651 --> 56:45.777
Mom, Dad…

56:47.028 --> 56:48.029
[sobs]

56:48.863 --> 56:50.031
I miss you.

56:50.949 --> 56:51.908
[chuckles]

56:51.991 --> 56:53.201
I miss you both.

56:53.284 --> 56:54.285
[sniffles]

56:55.370 --> 56:56.496
And, um…

56:58.915 --> 57:00.416
I'm so sorry.

57:05.296 --> 57:06.965
[sobs]

57:09.717 --> 57:11.302
Um, give it to me.

57:22.313 --> 57:23.189
Hey, Mom.

57:23.940 --> 57:25.442
I want a raise in allowance.

57:28.736 --> 57:30.238
-Is it ready to go?
-[Wu-jin] Yes.

57:30.905 --> 57:31.990
[clears throat]

57:32.907 --> 57:36.327
Music and lyrics
by intergalactic superstar Yang Dae-su.

57:37.537 --> 57:38.371
Beat.

57:38.455 --> 57:40.331
[foot tapping]

57:40.415 --> 57:42.667
[singing in Korean]
♪ Chicken tastes better fried ♪

57:42.750 --> 57:44.544
♪ In olive oil ♪

57:44.627 --> 57:47.964
♪ Pork tastes better than soy meat ♪

57:48.047 --> 57:51.259
♪ Strawberry cake tastes better
Than plain strawberries ♪

57:51.342 --> 57:54.929
♪ What makes me laugh, laugh, laugh ♪

57:55.013 --> 57:56.389
♪ Is trans fat ♪

57:56.473 --> 57:57.557
[Dae-su] Cheong-san?

58:05.523 --> 58:08.526
[mellow music]

58:13.490 --> 58:14.324
Mom.

58:16.534 --> 58:17.410
It's me.

58:18.453 --> 58:19.829
Dad, you're okay too, right?

58:22.415 --> 58:23.291
I'm…

58:25.376 --> 58:26.544
I'm good.

58:28.296 --> 58:30.298
[somber music]

58:52.862 --> 58:53.696
Hi, Dad.

58:54.948 --> 58:55.823
I miss you.

58:57.534 --> 58:59.744
You're not here,
but I waited for you all night,

58:59.827 --> 59:01.496
and we're holding on together.

59:02.997 --> 59:07.043
You always say being healthy
is better than getting good grades.

59:07.126 --> 59:09.295
[gunshots]

59:16.010 --> 59:18.680
You said you'd be the first to come
if anything ever happened.

59:21.683 --> 59:23.142
And you're okay, right?

59:31.901 --> 59:33.903
You have to be okay, Dad.

59:34.529 --> 59:36.573
You don't have to come save me, but…

59:37.365 --> 59:38.575
[panting]

59:42.870 --> 59:44.872
But still, I wish you'd come.

59:47.333 --> 59:49.168
[sobbing]

59:49.252 --> 59:53.006
I really thought you would be here by now.

59:56.175 --> 59:57.969
[uplifting music]

01:00:07.061 --> 01:00:09.063
[On-jo sobbing]

01:00:10.732 --> 01:00:11.858
But I'm okay.

01:00:17.530 --> 01:00:19.907
Usually, I save this for my allowance.

01:00:22.493 --> 01:00:24.454
But I'll say it for free here.

01:00:26.831 --> 01:00:27.874
Dad, I…

01:00:29.542 --> 01:00:30.501
I love you.

01:00:35.089 --> 01:00:36.215
I love you.

01:00:40.219 --> 01:00:41.471
I really love you.

01:00:42.347 --> 01:00:44.349
[somber music]

01:00:55.693 --> 01:00:57.695
[ominous music]

01:01:38.152 --> 01:01:40.154
[closing theme music]

01:04:42.003 --> 01:04:44.005
ALL CHARACTERS, LOCATIONS,
ORGANIZATIONS,

01:04:44.088 --> 01:04:46.090
AND EVENTS IN THIS SHOW ARE FICTIONAL.
